{"1134170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RigorZ", "steam_appid": 1134170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AFTER THE OUTBREAK, THERE ARE NO RULES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The abandoned towns, farms and military outposts of Colorado belong to no one now. You wake up with a flashlight and half a magazine. Everything else depends on the risks you are willing to take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEATH TAKES EVERYTHING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Persistent inventory — every item you carry is real, and all of it drops where you die</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Secure storage at your shelter — you have to make it back alive to keep what you earned</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character progression survives death. Your gear does not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OTHER PLAYERS ARE THE REAL THREAT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infected are slow and predictable. The sniper behind the ridge is not. Firing your weapon means noise, and noise means a crowd. Every bullet is a decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD A CLAN, HOLD TERRITORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Clan system with shared storage and ranks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Territory control and clan versus clan warfare</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Battle Royale mode — 100 players, closing gas zone, one winner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAPS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorado, Cliffside, Frosty, Island, Rockyford and more, each with its own loot density and risk balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREE TO PLAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RigorZ is free to download and play. A permanent internet connection is required.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AFTER THE OUTBREAK, THERE ARE NO RULES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The abandoned towns, farms and military outposts of Colorado belong to no one now. You wake up with a flashlight and half a magazine. Everything else depends on the risks you are willing to take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEATH TAKES EVERYTHING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Persistent inventory — every item you carry is real, and all of it drops where you die</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Secure storage at your shelter — you have to make it back alive to keep what you earned</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character progression survives death. Your gear does not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OTHER PLAYERS ARE THE REAL THREAT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infected are slow and predictable. The sniper behind the ridge is not. Firing your weapon means noise, and noise means a crowd. Every bullet is a decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD A CLAN, HOLD TERRITORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Clan system with shared storage and ranks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Territory control and clan versus clan warfare</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Battle Royale mode — 100 players, closing gas zone, one winner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAPS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorado, Cliffside, Frosty, Island, Rockyford and more, each with its own loot density and risk balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREE TO PLAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RigorZ is free to download and play. A permanent internet connection is required.</p>", "short_